{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"4d4a87acc19cb668cf38f2fc46aeba543082fabf1ed7b8bd9f91ecbf67bf42f2","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"8cdedf3b1953d0e8d176d199c5c4181afe8dbae35c923325d97545d926b215ee","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"8d0d907d904c792b1f467821a1dee22708ab1da3c092bcdf8767de962161d090","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"8d11aada85b22c5b3710a74810f81e8b027198a48952c0b235f1212e830a93ad","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"原文 “effectively extending sleeping effects for as long as Dream Prison is maintainted” 的时限限定语被删：译文只说“有效地延长他们的睡眠效果”，把受“维持本技能期间”约束的延长说成无条件延长。补查：组件 engine（mod-tome），公开源码 game/modules/tome/data/talents/psionic/dreaming.lua，固定 commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63，第195-231行 newTalent{name=\"Dream Prison\", mode=\"sustained\", remove_on_zero=true, drain_psi=...}，info 第229行即该句；技能为持续型，延长效果随维持而存续，限定语属机制信息。"},{"revision_key":"8d218992878ddef90b8c4f1b3867a6e69a29fbf3541f1b82715f42a0e9b95e1c","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"8d225e79e615afd2afc73ddebb4ca0ce605598c8b7beebc19555bac3e2cc8683","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"专名 “the Master” 译作“领主”，引入原文没有的封建领主/封地统治义，丢失“主人／主宰”这一主从关系核心。补查：组件 engine（mod-tome），game/modules/tome/data/zones/dreadfell/npcs.lua，commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63，newEntity{define_as=\"THE_MASTER\", name=\"The Master\", type=\"undead\", subtype=\"vampire\", unique=true}；同 commit 的 game/modules/tome/data/lore/dreadfell.lua 第166-171行信件正文自称 “Thank you kindly, my servant; already you have served your Master well”，落款 “- The Master”，确证该称号指奴役亡灵仆从的“主人”。"},{"revision_key":"8d3a0405cbc2c5247c633e8ee11b06344dc35ddd42d741ef41fb692fd5d3d87f","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"机制限定语 per target 被删：原文 “The last effect cannot occur more than once per turn per target”，译文作“这一效果每回合最多只能触发一次”，误述为全局每回合一次，实际为每个目标各一次。补查：组件 engine（mod-tome），game/modules/tome/data/talents/cunning/scoundrel.lua，commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63，callbackOnMeleeAttack/callbackOnArcheryAttack（第64-81、82-101行）以 self.turn_procs.scoundrel[target] 按目标逐个记录并判重，故同回合可对不同目标各触发一次；info 第108行为被审源串。"},{"revision_key":"8d4f0b68ddcdf203d1b7f041c9f527e31631deadc5bc60e3f1875788bf0d7ec9","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"8d68b5b0b6f890b53055b42df38ca9b1bd52d1954b0c46b270d0dbce635e536e","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"8d6af83011e58f0211eaefab149392d625f5f2a80cca3e16b936bf3347896089","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"8d6f7fa832c7b6e29be30380748d91a32333788255b99c53b3156c11abce47a4","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"种族专名错译：yeek 被译为“夺心魔”（mind flayer 的通行译名），指向完全不同的生物；同时 “mental energies emitted by” 的“精神能量／散发”被弱化为“周围的能量”，丢失精神系属性与主动散发义。补查：组件 engine（mod-tome），game/modules/tome/data/zones/town-irkkk/npcs.lua，commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63，第71-73行 newEntity{base=\"BASE_NPC_IRKKK_TOWN\", name=\"yeek psionic\", desc=_t[[You can literaly feel the mental energies emitted by this yeek.]]}，所在区域为 yeek 族城镇 Irkkk。"},{"revision_key":"8d77bea6bf5885410fd83b5317d12a3384e9c391fe49318b0216332441fc56f7","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"8db532ffffc350df6d12ba8f8a46353a4ae7dcd76702c93d3b4620c852ec32db","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"8dc982f466e3f6f76e05218faf90263cc85305ae51740aef8aa9ea0a03f85506","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"过度具体化：原文 “pierced” 仅表“被刺穿”，译文“被刺破心脏”添加了原文没有的器官指涉，而该串属物理伤害的通用死亡描述词表，会随机套用于骷髅、构造体、软泥等无心脏单位。补查：组件 engine（mod-tome），game/modules/tome/data/damage_types.lua，commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63，第778行 death_message={_t\"battered\", ..., _t\"impaled\", ..., _t\"stabbed\", _t\"pierced\", ...}，为 PHYSICAL 伤害类型的通用列表。"},{"revision_key":"8dce16df9f3c5629f3eb800c4e6500b3bb79cd7285c4d9176d6a930bfacc09ce","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"8dd0ecb5b1cdfdd1ac3913f20f7549fd6b6ec1d3ef389b9c563e6d9b6842ec62","verdict":"OK"}]}